uniq - drop repeated lines

SYNOPSIS
    uniq [-c] [-d] [-u] [FILE]

DESCRIPTION
      -c   count how many of each
      -d   only the lines that repeated
      -u   only the lines that did not

    Adjacent lines only, which is all a stream lets you see without holding
    the whole of it - and why this and sort are so often written together.

SEE ALSO
    sort, wc
